'''Merc & Cat''' (にゃんことメルクCC) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Merc Awakens!]] They were added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Merc & Cat
|image = E 346.png
|appearance = [[Merc Awakens!]]
|money drop = 190¢ - 750¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy acts like a tougher [[Brollow]] having similar damage (15,000), but a lot more health (+80,000). Its knockback count is a lot less than Brollow's however which can be seen as an advantage as it will not continuously attack every time it is knocked back.

